{"title": "Shadowy Claws", "pageid": 31719, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shadowy_Claws", "categories": ["Class actions", "Melee unarmed attacks", "Actions", "Sources of Slashing damage", "Sources of Necrotic damage", "Bugs", "Actions that push or pull"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Claws_Bear.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Claws_Bear.webp/300px-Claws_Bear.webp, /w/images/f/f5/Claws_Bear.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Claws_Bear.webp/300px-Claws_Bear.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Claws_Bear.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Shadowy Claws</b> is a class action that <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Plush\" title=\"Shadow Plush\">Shadow Plush</a> uses as its basic attack.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nLash out with deadly claws and push the target back 1.5 m (5 ft).<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><